        <CHAR>a</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "a"}}140{{else}}4{{end}}" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="40952">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="55" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
      <CHAR>부착물(정착부, 연결부, 보강부)의 상태가 최상으로 탈락・낙하 위험이 없는 상태</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW>
      <ROW>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "b"}}139{{else}}6{{end}}" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="6118">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="110" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
        <CHAR>b</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "b"}}140{{else}}4{{end}}" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="40952">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="55" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
      <CHAR>경미한 손상(부식 초기, 미세 균열 등)이 발생하였으나 안전상 문제는 없으면, 진행 여부를 지속적으로 관찰하고 보수 여부를 결정하여야 하는 상태</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW>
      <ROW>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "c"}}139{{else}}6{{end}}" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="6118">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="110" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
        <CHAR>c</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "c"}}140{{else}}4{{end}}" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="40952">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="55" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
      <CHAR>앵커・볼트의 풀림 등 손상이 발생하여 보행자・차량 이용에 불쾌감을 유발할 수 있어 간단한 보수가 필요한 상태</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW>
      <ROW>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "d"}}139{{else}}6{{end}}" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="6118">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="110" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
        <CHAR>d</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "d"}}140{{else}}4{{end}}" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="40952">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="55" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
      <CHAR>앵커・볼트의 탈락, 용접부 손상 등으로 부착물의 낙하・전도 위험이 있어 즉각적인 보수가 필요한 상태</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW>
      <ROW>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "e"}}139{{else}}6{{end}}" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="6118">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="110" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
        <CHAR>e</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL>
        <CELL BorderFill="{{if other16.Grade == "e"}}140{{else}}4{{end}}" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="40952">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="55" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
      <CHAR>부착물의 탈락・붕괴 위험이 매우 높아 통행제한 및 사용금지 조치가 필요한 상태</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW>
      <ROW>
        <CELL BorderFill="114" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="6118">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="58" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="13">
        <CHAR>평가 등급</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL>
        <CELL BorderFill="25" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="40952">
